sec.p:
Data were sourced from a total of 245 subjects with a mean age of 31 ± 16 years, where two studies observed older (aged >55 years) subjects and eight studies were conducted in younger (aged <30 years) subjects (Table 3). Of the ten studies, one study was conducted in professional athletes, three studies observed recreationally active cohorts, while six studies were conducted in untrained subjects. The 20 groups in the analysis comprised male (8 groups), female (6 groups) and mixed (6 groups) cohorts.Table 3
